{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794978447530239491,"compiled_state":{"alias":"militant-vixenish-gorilla","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e74a434d6290c8e3c481cb7a5c6cc5cf315506650cf9c64572803841c7b9bc3c","event_uuid":"a8253bc1-172a-44a9-bf7b-c55c8a23c073","position":{"commit_sha":"216587bc93d2e9b884a24c46888bbe91ccdac2b1","position":"1794978434236791830-a8253bc1-172a-44a9-bf7b-c55c8a23c073"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"fcc69a45f30e15202dbc8b9779f874f907ec58e8d0afd516179cdcd35349aa23","event_uuid":"de366382-ff3a-4415-9a5f-81bfd0c50d5b","position":{"commit_sha":"4c83d6a6055fc68ffed83d4fa14007a532b8e916","position":"1794978447530239490-de366382-ff3a-4415-9a5f-81bfd0c50d5b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794978434236791830,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"de366382-ff3a-4415-9a5f-81bfd0c50d5b","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"77b6-868f-f4bd-461f"}],"description":"## Problem\n\n`src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/plan-review-g7.eval.yaml` declares `prompt: plan-review-G7` (line 13), and it is the only packaged spec whose filename differs from its `prompt` field (checked over every `src/rebar/llm/eval_specs/*.eval.yaml` at origin/main dd72b461814). `load_eval_spec(prompt_id)` (`src/rebar/llm/evals/eval.py:71`) opens `<prompt_id>.eval.yaml` verbatim (`_packaged_eval_spec`, `eval.py:63`), and `calibrate_criterion(\"G7\")` maps the criterion to `criterion_prompt_id(\"G7\") == \"plan-review-G7\"`.\n\nSo on a case-sensitive filesystem (Linux, including the GitHub ubuntu runners):\n\n- `calibrate_criterion(\"G7\")` / `rebar criteria eval G7` raise `EvalError: no eval spec for prompt 'plan-review-G7' at .../plan-review-G7.eval.yaml: [Errno 2] No such file or directory`.\n- The `eval-live` loop in `.github/workflows/prompt-eval.yml` takes `pid = spec[\"prompt\"]` (`plan-review-G7`) and calls `run_eval(pid)`, which raises the same uncaught `EvalError` and aborts the step before the specs that sort after it are run.\n\nmacOS's default case-insensitive filesystem hides it.\n\n## Evidence\n\nObserved in Gerrit change 3421 patch set 1 CI (GitHub run 44239093717, ubuntu py3.11/3.12/3.13 and eval-discipline): `tests/unit/test_eval.py::test_calibrate_criterion_opens_a_gate_session_for_its_solver` called `calibrate_criterion(\"G7\", ...)` and failed with exactly that `EvalError`; the same test passes on macOS. That test was switched to the `necessity` criterion so the change could land; the underlying mismatch is unchanged.\n\n## Expected\n\nThe G7 spec loads by its prompt id on every filesystem, and a test asserts that every packaged spec's filename equals its `prompt` field so a future mismatch fails in CI.\n","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["evals","ci"],"ticket_id":"3a94-70a5-8c3b-4c66","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Eval spec plan-review-g7.eval.yaml is named in lower case but its prompt is plan-review-G7, so it cannot be loaded on case-sensitive filesystems","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a8253bc1-172a-44a9-bf7b-c55c8a23c073","de366382-ff3a-4415-9a5f-81bfd0c50d5b"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794978447530239491,"uuid":"c2fc1a01-4b22-4aa1-8f1c-176b6dd113a4"}
